# The error diagnostic quotes the API's message, which quotes python_file. The
# path has an OSC set-window-title sequence, a CSI clear-screen sequence, an SGR
# color code and a carriage return in it. They must be shown escaped;
# show_control.py would show a raw one as <0x1b>.
trace musterr $CLI bundle deploy 2>&1 | show_control.py
